[
  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186133895,
      "id": "5f4f726e-d985-5915-a4d0-30cfa6f4b89b",
      "title": "Identifying Vector Fields That Satisfy the Unit Curl Property"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Let $C$ be a simple, piecewise-smooth, closed, and positively oriented curve. Given that the line integral\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r\n$$\n\n \nrepresents the area of the region $D$ enclosed by any such curve in ${R}^{2},$ which of the following could be the vector field $F(x,y)?$\n\nI. $F(x,y)=⟨4 y^{3},\\,{x}^{3}+1⟩$\n\nII. $F(x,y)=⟨\\sqrt{2} x + \\frac{y}{4},\\,\\frac{5 x}{4}⟩$\n\nIII. $F(x,y)=⟨x,\\,x⟩$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "According to Green's theorem, if $F(x,y)=⟨P(x,y),\\,Q(x,y)⟩,$ where\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=1,\n$$\n\nwe can write the area of the region $D$ enclosed by the curve $C$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Area}(D) & ={∬}_{D}\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∮}_{C}P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each pair in turn.\n\n- Vector field I does *not* give the required area. In this case, \n$\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=12 y^{2}$\nand\n$\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}=3{x}^{2},$\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=\\left(3{x}^{2}\\right)-\\left(12 y^{2}\\right)=\\left(3 x^{2}\\right)-\\left(12 y^{2}\\right)=3 x^{2} - 12 y^{2}\\ne 1.\n$$\n\n- Vector field II gives the required area. Notice that\n$\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=\\frac{1}{4}$\nand\n$\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}=\\frac{5}{4},$\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=\\left(\\frac{5}{4}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)=\\left(\\frac{5}{4}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)=1.\n$$\n\n- Vector field III gives the required area. Notice that\n$\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=0$\nand\n$\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}=1,$\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=\\left(1\\right)-\\left(0\\right)=\\left(1\\right)-\\left(0\\right)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "14b1494d-7f7e-520f-b67b-8cf704f1957b",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "e7c03e90-fd31-5ede-bb40-0d4b6812a6d1",
